{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02369","headline":"杂歌谣辞 邯郸郭公辞 · 温庭筠","name":"杂歌谣辞 邯郸郭公辞","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"金笳悲故曲，玉座积深尘。\n言是邯郸伎，不易邺城人。\n青苔竟埋骨，红粉自伤神。\n唯有漳河柳，还向旧营春。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"温庭筠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02369.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02369","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}